    <title>50+ Tools You NEED to Master Blockchain in 2022</title>
    <link href="/2022/05/11/2022/"/>
    <url>/2022/05/11/2022/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="1-Intro"><a href="#1-Intro" class="headerlink" title="1.Intro"></a>1.Intro</h2><h2 id="2-Programming-Languages"><a href="#2-Programming-Languages" class="headerlink" title="2.Programming Languages"></a>2.Programming Languages</h2><ul><li>Solidity</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>python</li><li>Rust</li></ul><h2 id="3-Frameworks-IDEs"><a href="#3-Frameworks-IDEs" class="headerlink" title="3.Frameworks &amp; IDEs"></a>3.Frameworks &amp; IDEs</h2><ul><li>Hardhat</li><li>Truffle</li><li>Brownie</li><li>dapp.tools</li><li>Remix</li><li><a href="docs.ethers.io">ethers</a></li><li><a href="">web3.js</a></li><li>[web3py]</li></ul><h2 id="4-Front-End"><a href="#4-Front-End" class="headerlink" title="4.Front End"></a>4.Front End</h2><ul><li>React</li><li>[useDApp]</li><li>[Scaffold-ETH]</li><li>[WalletConnect]</li></ul><h2 id="Test-Blockchains"><a href="#Test-Blockchains" class="headerlink" title="Test Blockchains"></a>Test Blockchains</h2><ul><li>Ganache &#x2F; GanacheCli<br>fork the real blockchain.</li><li>Hardhat<br>Mainnet forking</li></ul><h2 id="Nodes"><a href="#Nodes" class="headerlink" title="Nodes"></a>Nodes</h2><ul><li>infura</li><li>alchemy</li><li>QuickNode</li><li>geth(Go Ethereum)</li><li>OpenEthereum</li></ul><h2 id="Data"><a href="#Data" class="headerlink" title="Data"></a>Data</h2><ul><li><a href="https://thegraph.com/en/">thegraph</a></li><li>Bitquery</li></ul><h2 id="Libraries-SDKs"><a href="#Libraries-SDKs" class="headerlink" title="Libraries &amp; SDKs"></a>Libraries &amp; SDKs</h2><ul><li>OpenZeppelin</li><li><a href="https://docs.uniswap.org/sdk/introduction">Uniswap V3 SDK</a><br>V2 is very popular.</li><li><a href="https://compound.finance/docs/api">Compound SDK</a></li><li>Curve<br> Defi Llama</li></ul><h2 id="Faucets"><a href="#Faucets" class="headerlink" title="Faucets"></a>Faucets</h2><ul><li><a href="https://rinkebyfaucet.com/">rinkebyfaucet</a></li><li><a href="https://faucets.chain.link/">Chainlink Faucets</a></li></ul><h2 id="Oracles"><a href="#Oracles" class="headerlink" title="Oracles"></a>Oracles</h2><ul><li><a href="chain.link">Chainlink</a></li><li><a href="https://docs.chain.link/docs/chainlink-keepers/introduction/">Chainlink-keepers</a></li></ul><h2 id="Monitoring"><a href="#Monitoring" class="headerlink" title="Monitoring"></a>Monitoring</h2><ul><li><a href="https://bloxy.info/">Bloxy</a></li><li><a href="tenderly.co">tenderly</a></li></ul><h2 id="Hosting"><a href="#Hosting" class="headerlink" title="Hosting"></a>Hosting</h2><ul><li><a href="fleek.co">fleek</a></li><li><a href="pinata.cloud">Pinata</a></li><li></li></ul><h2 id="Auditing"><a href="#Auditing" class="headerlink" title="Auditing"></a>Auditing</h2><ul><li><a href="mythx.io">MythX</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/ConsenSys/mythril">Mythrill</a></li></ul><h2 id="Flash-Loans"><a href="#Flash-Loans" class="headerlink" title="Flash Loans"></a>Flash Loans</h2><ul><li><p><a href="https://docs.aave.com/faq/flash-loans">aave</a><br>  <a href="https://collateralswap.com/">collateralswap</a></p></li><li><p>dydx<br>  very low fee</p></li><li><p><a href="https://dodoex.github.io/docs/docs/flashSwap/">dodo</a><br>V2</p></li></ul><h2 id="Wallets"><a href="#Wallets" class="headerlink" title="Wallets"></a>Wallets</h2><ul><li><p>Metamask<br>go  </p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.coinbase.com/wallet">Coinbase Wallet</a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.argent.xyz/">argent</a><br>lay2 , zkSync , swap</p></li><li><p><a href="https://phantom.app/">Phantom</a><br>solana</p></li></ul><h2 id="Websites-Utilities"><a href="#Websites-Utilities" class="headerlink" title="Websites &amp; Utilities"></a>Websites &amp; Utilities</h2><ul><li><a href="https://eth-converter.com/">Ethereum Unit Converter</a></li><li><a href="https://etherscan.io/gastracker">Ethereum Gas Tracker</a></li><li><a href="https://ultrasound.money/">Ultra Sound</a></li><li>etherscan.io</li><li><a href="https://blockscan.com/address/0xea674fdde714fd979de3edf0f56aa9716b898ec8">blockscan.com</a><br>Click to view address on 12 other chains</li></ul><h2 id="Outro"><a href="#Outro" class="headerlink" title="Outro"></a>Outro</h2><ul><li><p><a href="https://www.defipulse.com/">Defi Pulse</a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://defillama.com/">Defi Llama</a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://l2beat.com/">L2 Beat</a></p></li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
    
